The APK as a whole

The APK includes icons from Vivid Plasma Themes and the terminal of dracxterm,
which are licensed under the GNU General Public License, version 3, so the
combined work is distributed under GPL-3.0. The LX-LAUNCHER source code keeps its Apache 2.0
license; Apache 2.0 code may be combined with GPL-3.0 work. The full GPL-3.0
text is in the app under assets/licenses/GPL-3.0.txt and in
third_party/vivid-icons/LICENSE.

Anyone who passes on the APK must also make its corresponding source
available under GPL-3.0 section 6. For the icons that source is the SVG files
in third_party/vivid-icons/svg together with scripts/render-vivid-icons.py,
which turns them into the bundled WebP images.

